  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "So it's four weeks since the operation on your left knee, how are you getting on?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Since last time the morning stiffness is a lot worse, it takes me a good half hour to get going."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look at the bend. You're getting to 85 degrees, which is reduced range for this stage."},
    {"role": "partner", "text": "Sorry I'm late, the parking was a nightmare. Hello!"},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "No worries, come and sit down, you're very welcome to stay."},
    {"role": "partner", "text": "Since last time he's been sleeping in the chair, I think, though he'll deny it."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I'm absolutely certain I've slept in bed every night."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Right, the wound has healed nicely and there's no heat around the joint."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Lie on your back, slide your heel towards your bottom as far as it'll go, hold for ten seconds, and do that fifteen times, every couple of hours."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "If the calf goes red, hot or swollen, ring the ward straight away."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "No lifting anything heavier than a kettle for now."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Okay, see you next week, both of you."}
  ],
